1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:02,540
(Howard:)Oh, good, you're home.

2
00:00:02,718 --> 00:00:04,948
(Howard:)Got a little surprise for you.

3
00:00:05,154 --> 00:00:06,174
Oh!

4
00:00:06,355 --> 00:00:09,885
(Howard:)Say hello to my little friend.

5
00:00:12,261 --> 00:00:16,461
Oh, my God, it's so cute.

6
00:00:16,632 --> 00:00:20,462
(Bernadette:)I didn't think there could be
a smaller version of you.

7
00:00:22,104 --> 00:00:23,124
(Howard:)I know, right?

8
00:00:23,306 --> 00:00:26,966
(Howard:)And thanks to photographs
and a little 3D modeling...

9
00:00:27,143 --> 00:00:29,513
(Howard:)...here comes the bride.

10
00:00:30,746 --> 00:00:33,776
- Oh, Howie, I love these.
- I thought you might.

11
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:37,110
- Were they expensive?
- It didn't cost a thing. I made them myself.

12
00:00:37,286 --> 00:00:38,616
- How?
- Koothrappali and I...

13
00:00:38,788 --> 00:00:42,158
(Howard:)...bought a used 3D printer for $5000.

14
00:00:42,391 --> 00:00:43,581
Heh, heh.

15
00:00:43,759 --> 00:00:47,749
Five thousand dollars for a couple of dolls?
Are you out of your mind?

16
00:00:48,664 --> 00:00:51,294
Not just a couple of dolls.

17
00:00:51,467 --> 00:00:55,027
(Howard:)For as many dolls as we want.

